 or try improbable duos.<br>Do you need an expert against boss fights or a proto-blacksmith that enhances your card upgrades?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803400/extras/dfc7985f6781c44aedde987423943fb1.poster.avif?t=1739198900\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803400/extras/dfc7985f6781c44aedde987423943fb1.webm?t=1739198900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803400/extras/a9b6451ca88960ecb105d6758ab92864.poster.avif?t=1739198900\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803400/extras/a9b6451ca88960ecb105d6758ab92864.webm?t=1739198900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Position on the battlefield has never been more important! Line up enemies for super attacks, move to a different zone to avoid being hit, or position enemies to knock into each other.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803400/extras/62b913ed1c8770bed6a6de46d466b501.poster.avif?t=1739198900\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803400/extras/62b913ed1c8770bed6a6de46d466b501.webm?t=1739198900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803400/extras/a505f7e7c29a89ac67aef2fe3f15ac84.poster.avif?t=1739198900\" ><source src=\"https://shared.a